(text "E4 - РЧ-тракт: DC-розв'язка, перемикачі, приймачі (3/4)" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left top)) (uuid 62267c0a-f2de-5ee0-b33a-a16a1c01387d))
(text "Дроти з'єднують контакти всередині функціональної групи; кожне дерево дротів має одну глобальну мітку з канонічною назвою мережі (рамка-стрілка — мережа виходить за межі групи, пряма рамка — мережа лише цієї групи). Однакові мітки з'єднані на всіх аркушах; земля — символ GND. Рамки OPEN — незакриті ворота з design/E#.json (повний реєстр: OPEN_ITEMS.md); «TBD» у значенні — STACK номіналу не задає, показано стартове значення до стенду." (at 15.24 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid 96afd842-f513-5ee0-a48b-f266fac02e29))
(text "DC detectors: common reference" (at 12.7 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid 87b12150-99c9-582e-b0a5-f60cceb5e58f))
(rectangle (start 12.7 35.56) (end 149.86 45.72) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid ce34f1da-ef7c-5bc8-ba20-f4fa93ba6ced))
(text "N-E4-01 — примітка — STACK §5.3 (DC-sense)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 37129e46-9364-5471-9b1f-a8db32200db9))
(text "Позначення R44xx/C44xx (4400–4499) — задокументований розширений діапазон E4 для DC-детекторів\n(design/E4-review.md), щоб не перетинатися з E5. Решта позначень E4 — у діапазоні 400–499." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a0c99f3f-156c-5f8b-b3c0-f09ac7397272))
(rectangle (start 12.7 48.26) (end 149.86 99.06) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 3b01e693-aa73-53cb-87ca-970a60590e8b))
(text "E4-06 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.3 (DC-sense); §8.1 HF-10" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f0128734-7caa-5e73-ae31-600e3db0697e))
(text "Three concrete protected bipolar DC-window detectors are designed; threshold, RF loading and power-off\nbackfeed still need prototype qualification. The ±30 V foreign-DC envelope covers the detector tap only: the\nassembled P2/P3/HF_CM ports share their DC node with E2 TPS2553/INA3221/U214 and polarized capacitors, which\nown bias OFF does not isolate, so a hardware blocking element is required.\nВорота (стенд): Verify each DCS LOW at 0 V and HIGH by ±0.100 V in both sweep directions over the admitted\ntemperature/supply range; record thresholds/hysteresis. Apply ±30 V limited foreign DC with Q6A ON/OFF,\nrequiring 3V3_Q6A <0.1 V when OFF, only at the detector tap with the bias branch disconnected (L403/L404 not\nfitted; A406 DC port unplugged from BONI13V8). On an assembled port never exceed −0.3…+5.5 V on P2/P3 or\n−0.3…+0.3 V on HF_CM with own bias OFF (TPS2553 OUT −0.3…7 V, INA3221 −0.3…26 V, TPS259630 OUT ≤VIN+0.3 V,\npolarized C239/C243/C273); the ±0.100 V sweep lies inside these limits. Hardware redesign required before this\ngate can close: a ±30 V-rated bidirectional blocking element in each sensed bias branch between the E2 output\nand the E4 injector (relay contact or back-to-back MOSFETs held open whenever EN_LNA2/EN_LNA3/EN_BONI is low,\nor a TPS2660-class ±60 V eFuse with reverse-polarity and reverse-current blocking), keeping\nTPS2553/INA3221/U214 and the electrolytics on the protected side; the detector is not that protection. Then\nrepeat ±30 V at each assembled port. Measure RF tap IL/RL/NF impact. Require startup/reference-fault HIGH and\nown bias OFF ≥500 ms before preflight; readiness stays false until qualified. Check floating/open antenna as\nwell as 0 Ω/50 Ω DC loads. Include the 996 Ω bleed load in current baselines and measure its RF\nloss/parasitics. Reject false-safe at ±0.100 V; false-unsafe units also fail usability qualification. Also\nqualify cold minimum-supply reference-feed headroom: the arithmetic model requires D450 Vf ≤1.015 V at VDD\n3.135 V and REF 2.072 V for at least 80 µA LM4040 cathode current. Reference collapse must force HIGH, and\nmust not be misreported as a working detector." (at 13.97 51.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6af25692-a751-5bf7-918e-3fe5289c6964))
